<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kemayan net profit up 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kemayan net profit up 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to May 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  36.30   vs	  30.99</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 11.26   vs	  11.45</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	  0.50   vs	   0.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		   587.49   vs	 346.87</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    62.92   vs	  51.26</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  1.69   vs  less   6.16</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    gain  1.30   vs  loss   1.62</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Kemayan Corp Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
